  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      230.29,
      500.42,
      257.4
    ],
    "text": "Two Suspects Arrested in Connection with Shooting and Murder \u2013 Nawagamuwa Police Station",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      271.84,
      522.23,
      312.72
    ],
    "text": "A person who sustained injuries in a shooting incident carried out by an unidentified gunman in the Bellanwila area of the Boralesgamuwa Police Division succumbed to his injuries after being admitted to Kalubowila Hospital on the night of 25 July 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      327.28,
      521.51,
      368.16
    ],
    "text": "Following the incident, a team of officers from the Nawagamuwa Police Station arrested two suspects who were allegedly fleeing on a motorcycle after carrying out the shooting and murder. The arrests were made in the Ranala area on the same night.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      382.72,
      503.77,
      409.8
    ],
    "text": "Police also recovered 6 grams and 600 milligrams of heroin and the motorcycle allegedly used by the suspects, which were taken into police custody.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      424.26,
      487.06,
      437.54
    ],
    "text": "The arrested suspects are 28 and 37 years old and are residents of the Bakamuna area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      452.1,
      419.95,
      465.38
    ],
    "text": "Further investigations are being conducted by the Nawagamuwa Police.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
